              "Rubio, in particular, has kept up his rhetoric against the company on Twitter for most of this week.\n\nBut with Huawei already mostly locked out of the U.S. market, and with less dependence on U.S. suppliers, it has a lot less to lose than ZTE.\n\nChina's ZTE To Pay $1 Billion Fine To Settle U.S. Trade Case"
            ]
          }
        ],
